        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CAUSALITY_INVERSION",
        "analysis": "因果倒置。首段第二句指出：‘Science and technology would cure ... leading to lives of fulfillment’，追求充实完满的生活是科学技术治愈弊病后所‘带来的结果（leading to）’，而非最初激发积极未来愿景的驱动源头。"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "our faith in science and technology.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至首段：“Up until a few decades ago, our visions of the future were largely ... glowingly positive. Science and technology would cure all the ills of humanity ...” 过去几十年前我们对未来的美好憧憬之所以洋溢积极，是因为人们对‘科学技术能够治愈人类一切问题’怀抱极高信任与信仰，our faith in science and technology 正是原文核心驱动因的精准概括。",
